                <pb facs="0876" n="868" sameAs="frus:frus1938v01/pg868"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/1074: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in the
                        United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-12-12T16:00:00-05:00">December 12, 1938—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>770. For Rublee. Your 1416, December 9, 4 p.m. Warren has communicated direct
                    with Rothschild. In connection with preliminary studies, please advise
                    specifically what part of British Guiana the 40,000 square miles comprises. Is
                    the figure of 40,000 confidential?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
